  "description": "He is the young and powerful emperor of an empire whose influence continues to grow. She is the princess of a small exotic kingdom and grew up in the desert. Offered to the emperor by her brother who became king, she finds herself left to her own devices in a court whose codes are unknown to her. But her innocence and her naivety melt the emperor who grants her the title of concubine after their first carnal embraces. Despite their differences, the chemistry is perfect between them. But very quickly, the jealousy of other concubines and the disapproval of statesmen are felt ...",
